  "outlook": "Outlook for the First Quarter Fiscal 2026: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $424.0 million to $434.0 million in the first quarter of fiscal 2026, compared to $406.3 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 4.4% to 6.8%. Gross margin is expected to be in the range of 44.25% to 44.75% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 16.75% to 17.25%."
